---
title: "shuffle (Sui Framework: random)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_empty: n = v.length()
    q_check_empty --> q_return_empty: n == 0
    q_return_empty --> [*]: return (no-op)
    q_check_empty --> q_check_length: n > 0
    q_check_length --> q_abort: n > U16_MAX
    q_abort --> [*]: abort EInvalidLength
    q_check_length --> q_loop: n <= U16_MAX
    q_loop --> q_gen_j: for i in 0..n-2
    q_gen_j --> q_swap: j = generate_u16_in_range(g, i, n-1)
    q_swap --> q_loop: v.swap(i, j)
    q_loop --> [*]: vector shuffled

    note right of q_gen_j
        INV-001: Fisher-Yates/Knuth shuffle algorithm
        INV-002: uniform distribution of permutations
        INV-003: vector length limited to U16_MAX (65535)
        INV-004: each element equally likely to be in any position
    end note
